<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PermissionSet xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <description>Community (Experience Cloud) permission set for tenants. Grants read-only access to their own Tenancy, Room, Property, Notices, and Rent Payment invoices. Allows creation of Cases (Complaints and Maintenance Requests). Assign to Customer Community or Customer Community Plus user licences. Record-level access is enforced by sharing rules that share only the tenant's own records based on Community_User__c matching the logged-in user.</description>
